{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f51609262cc07c443499bfaea13f9566111d925659716115eea938e37034fc14", "ja": "オン状態が続く杏奈のリフレッシュのため\n遊園地にきた瑞希、海美、茜、亜美、杏奈。\nアトラクションを全力で楽しんだ後、杏奈は\nプロデューサーと言葉を交わすことで安心し\n無事オフ状態に戻れるようになるのだった。", "zh": "为了让一直保持开启模式的杏奈转换心情，\n瑞希、海美、茜、亚美和杏奈来到了游乐园。\n尽情畅玩游乐设施后，杏奈与制作人\n交谈了一番，心里终于感到安心，\n也顺利地能够切换回关闭模式了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3e9c46ae5421a8d5628b4f009db8788309a59dcb9db05ebe46d23529b72593c2", "ja": "（杏奈は、新曲公演も全速力で突っ走ってくれた！\n大きな仕事が一段落した後は……）", "zh": "（杏奈也全速完成了新曲公演！在一项重要工作告一段落之后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "78a7306d8d44b7185606858d952ec72e82387d756b3bcc012681891d775c45e3", "ja": "捉えたよ、もっちー……！\n今度こそ……亜美の勝ちだーっ！！", "zh": "抓到你了，望月……！\n这次一定……亚美赢啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "2b9454c8a505f979b8613b20e5cd9a38fe3a657a4e7a24e4b9965e50701977f6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，就是现在……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b938f7970ce1ae68a68aa042cb7a4ddb3ef811130a6360e21e5afac9331694d2", "ja": "ああ、かかったな亜美！　くらえ！！", "zh": "啊，上钩了吧，亚美！接招！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1004_null", "source_sha256": "0872d41f755a8cf126993348acfeb5d63a7426c201b9154b8444176d6fc9c13c", "ja": "ズキュンズキューン！\nWINNER TEAM RED！", "zh": "心动连击——！\n获胜队伍：红队！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "fcc59dd095509fcf4bd32e8ec20cced6a961ffded52c28111d561ab95e63b791", "ja": "うあうあ！　また負けたー！？\n今度こそ勝てると思ったのに～！", "zh": "哇啊哇啊！又输了——！？\n明明觉得这次肯定能赢的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "a89fdbccda0caaaceeff1fde0c2a6c8a614a6c0ff1f61686f7b1a1c267483859", "ja": "まさか、亜美さんと組んでも\n負けてしまうとは。……お見事。", "zh": "真没想到，就算和亚美小姐组队\n还是输了。……甘拜下风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1007_p", "source_sha256": "32d08b1349f8ddbe2e4239e34c8ce06f6224a36be80363ec0161aeb2e1c69f5e", "ja": "俺はほとんど何もしてないけどな……。\n杏奈にお膳立てしてもらっちゃって。", "zh": "我基本什么都没做……都是杏奈帮我安排好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "07343257ea9902f27658c93ec204629bc42f8bf94c5054f326e13e2d8da02278", "ja": "ふたりとも……杏奈のこと、気にし過ぎ……。\n亜美ちゃんは、特に……。", "zh": "你们两个……太在意杏奈了……\n尤其是，亚美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "e7020c4be7b8f3c91b95b84080f6189a767e7d7ee6326d922999b89d960f3372", "ja": "ムキー！　もっちーが上手すぎるだけっしょ！？", "zh": "气死我了！只是杏奈太厉害了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "de3059fa6a984311d847eb5d40c901c56fa641a2b90a2c9c1960f2a1f80bb248", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、すっかり元通りだね。茜ちゃんと並ぶ、\n劇場のしっとりおしとやかガールだよ♪", "zh": "杏奈已经完全恢复原样了呢。和小茜并列，是剧场里温柔娴静的女孩哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "8300f0025d3d02dba8eefd4c48a40ccbcd51faa796dc38b03fbf5b1ca401f6b5", "ja": "でも、新曲公演の時はすっごくはじけてたよね！\n今までより元気なくらい☆", "zh": "不过，在新歌公演的时候，你可是特别活跃呢！简直比以前还要有精神☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "34b65ad97e22f463dba787b6cb825f866e44e46f73a166a3d92d367d5af42416", "ja": "そういえば……元に戻れたきっかけは、\nなんだったのでしょうか？", "zh": "说起来……能恢复原状的契机，\n究竟是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "e0cc239f077a65cf37d0f78771e794965f495a45253df47a0e8d0fe1f572a370", "ja": "遊園地で遊んだ日に戻ってたよね？\nやっぱり『うみみん式スイッチオフ』が効いたの？？", "zh": "我们是在游乐园玩那天恢复的吧？果然是“海美式关机”起作用了？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "b343b617fa90cc171bd0bf65b88240ac4c1b5a2dbcc0a76190289e6d650e6b41", "ja": "ん……。杏奈も、よくわかんない……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也不太清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "efb4878b49289b657820befb151422769bd34ef0b6cd790440fbadef477bf36e", "ja": "えっ、わかんないんだ。それじゃあ、\nまた戻れなくなるかもしれない感じ？", "zh": "诶，你也不知道啊。那就是说，可能又会有回不来的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "b39cd9a423eee1d882af1808640597211289e4d865813fda91c350441b8659e3", "ja": "ううん……。\nもう、大丈夫って……思い、ます……。", "zh": "不……已经没事了……我想……应该……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "eb835d96089a1e28da3bfe2086445b57eab8f28890344e9d743cc050b9042335", "ja": "どっちの杏奈も、ちゃんと……\n見てくれてる、って……わかったから……。", "zh": "因为两个杏奈都在好好地……\n看着我……我明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "3a26af62e5f164d238a712ac1f43bcaf45b54b6ad155f84835ff0515f05b6e5a", "ja": "見るに決まってるよ！　もっちーから目を離したら、\nいつ背中から撃たれるかわかんないし～！", "zh": "那还用说！要是把眼睛从桃子身上移开，\n说不定什么时候就被从背后偷袭了哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "c5a7c4d8bf059c54b3bcdde9af7a0fe7efe0657709e1fbf32c91af27d4261037", "ja": "さあ、もう一戦いこうか！　負けっぱなしじゃ、\nゲームの申し子・亜美の名が泣くかんね！　うわーん！", "zh": "来吧，再来一局！要是一直输下去，游戏之子亚美的名号可就要哭鼻子了！呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9eb3f7fcdf35f3b758712ed5dfb8aede10121d5cf7a0b25079576ab2e68c1209", "ja": "もう泣いてるじゃないか……。", "zh": "不是已经在哭了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "637256d429ba669f62d6514e28907447c7a9e83869e673199caa797d544b856f", "ja": "細かいことはいーの！　というわけで\nもっちー、アーユーレディ？", "zh": "细节什么的就别在意啦！话说回来，安娜，你准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_125_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_125_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "94cb9b8db82d16524b87e9c4c342577e632af2fb62198493123b340491916bb9", "ja": "まだ……。今度は、海美さんと茜さんも、\n一緒に……チーム決め……。", "zh": "还没……这次，海美小姐和茜小姐也要一起……决定队伍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
